  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"116\"><em data-end=\"179\" data-start=\"142\">Luxury Fashion Made Pocket-Friendly</em><br data-end=\"182\" data-start=\"179\">We offer luxury jewelry that combines exquisite craftsmanship with affordability. Our collections feature stunning details and captivating designs that make you look and feel your best without breaking the bank. Every piece is carefully curated to bring you the perfect balance of elegance and style.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description: Our Ayatul Kursi jewelry collection is a tribute to timeless elegance and spiritual significance. Each piece is designed with intricate detailing, offering a beautiful blend of modern aesthetics and traditional symbolism. Crafted with precision, Ayatul Kursi jewelry is not only a fashion statement but also a representation of protection, peace, and strength.&nbsp;<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): <em data-end=\"958\" data-start=\"944\">Ayatul Kursi</em><br data-end=\"961\" data-start=\"958\">Inspired by the revered Ayatul Kursi verse, our jewelry embodies spiritual meaning, elegance, and protection. This exclusive collection brings together sacred symbolism and luxury design, offering more than just beauty&mdash;it's a piece of jewelry with a deeper connection to your faith and style.&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1260\">To make your shopping experience as smooth as possible, we offer a variety of secure payment options:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1436\" data-start=\"1385\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1395\" data-start=\"1385\">PayPal</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1396\">Stripe</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1414\" data-start=\"1407\">UPI</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1423\" data-start=\"1415\">Visa</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1436\" data-start=\"1424\">MasterCard</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information: Explore our full collection of Ayatul Kursi jewelry and more by visiting our website. Experience the perfect blend of luxury, design, and spiritual symbolism.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>",
